Package: fundecomp
Type: Package
Title: Decomposition of Functional Biodiversity Change
Version: 5.0.0
Authors@R: person("Pierre", "Gaüzère", email = "pierre.gauzere@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Pierre Gaüzère [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Pierre Gaüzère <pierre.gauzere@gmail.com>
Description: Extends the Measurement of Biodiversity framework to decompose
    changes in functional metrics into proximate changes in total abundance,
    spatial aggregation, the species-abundance distribution, the species-trait
    distribution, and Trait-Abundance association. Optional individual trait
    observations support a within-species trait variation component. Includes
    small teaching datasets from the s3cR package.
